      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      According to Proposition <a href="/tag/C2730C" data-tag="C2730C">5.5.3.3</a>, $p$ is classified by a functor $\chi : S \rightarrow \LPres $. Using Proposition <a href="/tag/D3F34F" data-tag="D3F34F">5.5.3.13</a>, we deduce that the limit of the composite diagram 
    <p>
      <div class="equation">
  \[  S \rightarrow \LPres \rightarrow \widehat{\Cat }_{\infty } \]
</div>
    <p>
       is presentable. Corollary <a href="/tag/2A1AE7" data-tag="2A1AE7">3.3.3.2</a> allows us to identify this limit with the $\infty $-category $\calC $. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
